ui helpers to enable, disable, and uncheck radio buttons and checkboxes

Usage:
$('input[type=radio]').disable(); //$('#blastn').disable();
$('input[type=radio]').filter(':disabled').enable();
$('input[type=radio]').filter(':checked').uncheck();

